    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan arranges immortal materials in front of himself while testing sword dragon transformation. The first piece is hundred years profound ice; a claw sweep feels like slicing tofu and smashes the profound ice into pieces.",
      "chapters": [
        1197
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "claw-strength-test",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Along the way through a public grotto-heaven, hundred years profound ice is named among small to mid sized resource points with plentiful storage, together with ice mirror snow lotus, thousand years profound ice, mystical frost water, and heaven craft divine jade.",
      "chapters": [
        1638
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "resource-point-name",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The same list of resource points, including hundred years profound ice, appears again when the grotto-heaven is described as opening only once a hundred years and thus accumulating many resources in closely packed small and mid sized points.",
